  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">RecommendationITU-T Y.3157 specifies a network slice configuration in order to dynamicallycreate and manage network slice instances (NSIs) in the International MobileTelecommunications-2020(IMT-2020) network. Detailed topics are methods for: creation of an NSI;provision of quality of service (QoS) to the network slice; and association ofuser equipment (UE) application services with the NSI.Networkslicing is regarded as a key technology in the successful deployment of the IMT-2020network. The concept of network slicing and use cases in the IMT-2020 networkare introduced in Recommendation ITU-T Y.3112.</abstract>
